# A block with both a start and a due date in the coming week is listed once, under the earlier of the two.
file <<END
- Both @start({today+4}) @due({today+2})
- Other @due({today+3})
END
keys gU
see Upcoming
see ▌ - Both
keys j
see ▌ - Other
keys j x
quit
saved <<END
- Both @start({today+4}) @due({today+2})
- Other @due({today+3}) @done({today})
END
